Your account will now be checked for valid user information. If the data
you've entered passes all the checks you can then be validated. If there is a
problem you will be informed what the problem is and what you must do before
you can be validated.

If the checks have been passed and we have received Caller-ID info that
matches the number in your records you will be validated immediately.

If you are in the local calling area and have turned Caller-ID off, you will
be given the option to use callback validation instead.

If you are a long distance caller and Caller-ID information is not available,
please send feedback asking the Sysop to validate you manually.

\c6Press \c7\z4ANY KEY\z0\c6 to continue\g1